id relief-allocation
title Share a relief fund exactly
lang trebago
audience public agencies, central banks, cooperatives, aid funds
safety none
summary A relief fund is shared across districts: a floor for each, the rest by population, in exact fractions and then whole cents that add up to the fund to the cent.
inputs inputs.txt
step allocate trebago relief.tb counts=fund,floor,pop nonneg=rest labels=districts
